    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπήγνῡμι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πήξω </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπήξομαι</span> is <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πτύξομαι</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>):—<i>fix to</i> or <i>on</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί [τι</span>] <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				679
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρός τι</span>”
