			: abs., <i>crucify, Act. Ap.</i><i><span class="en">
				2.23
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			 with pf.
			
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πέπηγα</span>, <i>to be fixed on</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.4.72
